    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "A Fang Yuan stone nest in Hu Immortal blessed land refines mortal star thought Gu all the time; star thought Immortal Gu would let him redirect that nest into airsac Gu production and raise his income instead. It is also one of the two core Immortal Gu of the immortal killer move star fog concealment, which defends against other people’s deductions and leaves them unclear and inaccurate.",
        "chapters": [
          904
        ],
        "certainty": "inferred",
        "confidence": "C",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wanting-the-recipe",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_stone_nest",
          "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
          "gu_airsac_gu",
          "move_star_fog_concealment"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Blazing Heaven Demoness recruits Fang Yuan and funds his refinement materials, sending three sets through Bo Dan against a debt that grows the longer he takes to repay it. Wisdom path grandmaster attainment, paired with star path grandmaster attainment, lets Fang Yuan modify the recipe himself: he has already replaced eleven unstable fusion steps with steps of higher success rate. Three refinement attempts have already failed.",
        "chapters": [
          926
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "recipe-funding-and-modification",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_blazing_heaven_demoness",
          "char_bo_dan",
          "path_wisdom"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Searching ruins in a desolate purple sand desert, Fang Yuan finds eighteen immortal materials whose dao marks span most Gu paths. Three of them carry heavy star path or wisdom path dao marks and suit the recipe well enough that he could refine the Gu without Blazing Heaven Demoness’s funding at all.",
        "chapters": [
          936
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "independent-materials",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan asks Blazing Heaven Demoness outright whether she tampered with the materials she funded him. She admits it without a trace of embarrassment.",
        "chapters": [
          946
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "sabotaged-materials",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan sets the refinement of star thought Immortal Gu aside. Its success rate is too low, the losses have been heavy, and he now feels sick whenever he hears about refining Immortal Gu at all.",
        "chapters": [
          952
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "refinement-shelved",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After his rebirth, Fang Yuan succeeds on his first refinement attempt, helped by practice carried over from his previous life, and perhaps also by luck that has improved since he connected his luck to Hei Lou Lan. He uses the newly refined Gu to finish unraveling the freezing rain frozen earth battlefield killer move for Shark Demon at Yu Lu blessed land, then grasps eighty to ninety percent of fighting soul battlefield and eight doors labyrinth as well.",
        "chapters": [
          982
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "first-successful-refinement",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_hei_lou_lan",
          "char_shark_demon",
          "loc_yu_lu_blessed_land"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
