  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Of the three wisdom path Immortal Gu that form the core of Dong Fang Chang Fan’s killer move myriad star fireflies, the one Fang Yuan wants most is star thought Immortal Gu. The inheritance carries its recipe along with the refinement experience, and the failures, of every past inheritor who tried it. By the inheritance’s account, one bead of green grape immortal essence spent through it yields a hundred thousand star thoughts. Fang Yuan would get fewer, because each past inheritor carried wisdom path dao marks that amplified the Gu. When Dong Fang Chang Fan lost, he self-detonated all his Immortal Gu and left none to Fang Yuan.",
        "chapters": [
          820
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "char_dong_fang_chang_fan",
          "move_myriad_star_fireflies",
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Blazing Heaven Demoness offers three conditions: fund the refinement again without tampering, give Fang Yuan a revival method for his immortal zombie state, and give him a sixty-year lifespan Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          947
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "a-second-honest-funding-round",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_sixty_year_lifespan_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "With untampered materials, refinement fails again at its final stage. There the dao marks shift in a way nobody can control, so only luck decides whether they settle correctly. Zombie Alliance then drafts every Northern Plains immortal zombie, Blazing Heaven Demoness included, into a mandatory Gu-formation project, and her funding for Fang Yuan stops before he can try again.",
        "chapters": [
          950
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "failure-luck-and-lost-funding",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_zombie_alliance",
          "reg_northern_plains",
          "sys_gu_formation"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Their alliance agreement obliges her to compensate him for the broken funding, so Blazing Heaven Demoness waives the immortal materials she already sent him.",
        "chapters": [
          951
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "debt-waived",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Blazing Heaven Demoness brings Fang Yuan into Ascending Heaven Plain to test his wisdom path methods against its shifting space path dao marks. With star thought Immortal Gu he no longer lacks star thoughts, and that gives him the confidence to press deep toward Old Eccentric Tian Nan’s Immortal Gu House.",
        "chapters": [
          986
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "deducing-ascending-heaven-plain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_ascending_heaven_plain",
          "char_old_eccentric_tian_nan",
          "sys_immortal_gu_house"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan later modifies star fog concealment with the light of wisdom, star thought Immortal Gu stays one of its two cores, now beside unravel mystery Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          987
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "deducing-ascending-heaven-plain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_unravel_mystery"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan counts rank six star thought Gu among his wisdom path assets, with rank eight wisdom sword Gu and rank nine wisdom Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          995
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "wisdom-path-assets",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_wisdom_sword_gu",
          "gu_wisdom_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Long after, Star Constellation Immortal Venerable asks Fang Yuan for a second Immortal Gu. After hesitating between Star Eyes and star thought Immortal Gu, he gives her star thought Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          2231
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "given-to-star-constellation-immortal-venerable",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
